Z||000000||Hank is Here||01-18-2001||08:56 PM||||Okay, <BR>for a wile now a year or so I have been seeing these round bumper stickers that say OBX.  The look like the European stickers that identify what country you are from.  I can think of any country that is OBX.  So what is it?  Am I just that dense that I can't figure it out?<BR><P>------------------<BR>Hank is Here<BR>87 GT<BR>88 Coupe<BR>84 SE<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://a1060.g.akamai.net/f/1060/597/30minutes/www.zing.com/picture/p60e80970138058d8e3fae31692e151e0/fef43e85.jpg"> ||||reg||1
