Z||000005||bHooper||01-19-2001||08:12 AM||||OBX=Outer Banks<P>for those of you not familiar with the beautifull state of NC, the Outer Banks are the barier (i spelled that wrong, didnt i?) islands on the coast.  these are the islands that many pirates hid in and around (Blackbeard, for one), as well as the Grave yard of the Atlantic... there are more ship wrecks ber square mile than anywhere else !<P>if you ever get a chance, you need to check em out!  <P><BR>hoop||||reg||1
